{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117394","id":3394808637,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7KWKs9","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117394","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117394.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117394.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117394","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117394/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117394/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117394/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4034cf067c4d3204abb42fb6402826f89ca0d9fe","number":117394,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add audio preview controls to MP3 and OGG AudioStream subclassess","user":{"login":"seppoday","id":62170071,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYyMTcwMDcx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/62170071?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday","html_url":"https://github.com/seppoday","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/seppoday/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Resolves: [Issue #14356](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/14356)\r\n\r\nPreviously, the audio preview panel (play/stop controls and waveform) in the inspector was only shown for AudioStreamWAV. This change extends it to all AudioStream subclasses.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nUpdate after: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117394#issuecomment-4055443880\r\n\r\n- We now display preview on WAV, MP3 and OGG - not all stream types. Displaying on all stream types was bad idead because of Audio Randomizer, Audio Playlist and similar subclasses.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nChanges:\r\n- (that change was removed in final ver.) **include audio_stream_wav.h** was removed as it seems to be not needed anymore\r\n- (that change was removed in final ver.)  **can_handle** now accepts any AudioStream instead of only AudioStreamWAV\r\n- Streams without a fixed length (e.g. AudioStreamRandomizer) show \"dynamic\" instead of \"0.00s\" - (This change can be discussed)\r\n- **_draw_indicator** guards against division by zero when stream length is 0\r\n- **_draw_preview** shows \"Waveform preview not available\" for streams without a fixed length instead of attempting to generate an empty waveform  - (This change can be discussed)\r\n- **AudioStreamOggVorbis get_length** no longer prints an error when packet_sequence is null - After my changes it was printing errors, so I have to modify get_length. MP3 and WAV was fine because it always return 0.\r\n\r\nExamples:\r\nMP3 Before:\r\n<img width=\"446\" height=\"243\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/07eb718b-f4b4-4ff7-b789-258c468242ba\" />\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nMP3 (and OGG etc.) After:\r\n<img width=\"402\" height=\"349\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7bc08615-e654-4dde-98f0-365ff76195e3\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nEmpty WAV Before:\r\n<img width=\"436\" height=\"354\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e1e47ba1-2b39-430d-9df9-5da852f84814\" />\r\n\r\nEmpty WAV (and any other audio resource) After:\r\n<img width=\"411\" height=\"328\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/06e5616a-b2a7-46ae-8eb1-00172215269b\" />\r\n\r\nAudio Randomizer before:\r\n<img width=\"407\" height=\"713\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d69db86e-5d7f-499a-8ac5-58b6e8b68dc7\" />\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n<img width=\"500\" height=\"1072\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/494b30bd-01eb-4d29-9028-97045edc5df0\" />\r\n\r\n\r\nAI disclaimer: Ai was used to help me with implementing those changes. Sorry if that generate additional work for maintainers to check if everything is correct. I was trying to find simple issues to solve as a beginner. Most of the things were already implemented all I had to change was to add preview controls to more subclasses and make sure that this change does not brake anything. I am pretty sure it works great. Checked every stream resource and I hope this PR helps in some way :)","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":572781997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-03-13T12:13:33Z","updated_at":"2026